#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to use a virtual private endpoint to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform."
msgstr ""
"Comment utiliser un point de terminaison privé virtuel pour se connecter en "
"privé à IBM Quantum Platform."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform"
msgstr ""
"Utiliser les points de terminaison privés virtuels pour VPC afin de se "
"connecter en privé à IBM Quantum Platform"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore FDQN */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore FDQN */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-connect-to-"
"ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr ""
"Utiliser les points de terminaison privés virtuels pour VPC afin de se "
"connecter en privé à IBM Quantum Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-"
"for-vpc-to-privately-connect-to-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Virtual Private Endpoints (VPE) for VPC to connect to IBM Quantum&reg; "
"from your VPC network by using IP address that you specify, allocated from a"
" subnet within your VPC.\n"
msgstr ""
"Utilise les Points de Terminaison Privés Virtuels (VPE) pour VPC afin de te "
"connecter à IBM Quantum&reg; depuis ton réseau VPC en utilisant l'adresse IP"
" que tu spécifies, allouée depuis un sous-réseau dans ton VPC.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"VPEs are virtual IP interfaces that are bound to an endpoint gateway created"
" on a per-service basis. The endpoint gateway is a virtualized function that"
" scales horizontally, is redundant and highly available, and spans all "
"availability zones of your VPC. Endpoint gateways enable communications from"
" virtual server instances within your VPC and IBM Cloud&reg; service on the "
"private backbone. VPE for VPC lets you control all private addressing within"
" your cloud. For more information, see [About virtual private endpoint "
"gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"
msgstr ""
"Les VPE sont des interfaces IP virtuelles liées à une passerelle de point de"
" terminaison créée sur une base par service. La passerelle de point de "
"terminaison est une fonction virtualisée qui s'adapte horizontalement, est "
"redondante et très disponible, et couvre toutes les zones de disponibilité "
"de ton VPC. Les passerelles de point de terminaison permettent la "
"communication entre les instances de serveurs virtuels au sein de ton VPC et"
" le service IBM Cloud&reg; sur le réseau privé. VPE pour VPC te permet de "
"contrôler tout l'adressage privé dans ton cloud. Pour plus d'informations, "
"consulte [À propos des passerelles de point de terminaison privé "
"virtuel](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Within IBM Quantum Platform, all customer data is transmitted over the "
"private network regardless of whether it is accessed through a public "
"endpoint or VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Au sein d'IBM Quantum Platform, toutes les données client sont transmises "
"sur le réseau privé, que ce soit via un point de terminaison public ou via "
"VPE.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Connecting to IBM Quantum Platform through the public endpoints transmits "
"all request and response data over the public internet. To connect to IBM "
"Quantum Platform by using a VPE, you must use the IBM Quantum Platform API "
"or SDK. IBM Quantum Platform can only be accessed through the public "
"network.\n"
msgstr ""
"La connexion à IBM Quantum Platform via les points de terminaison publics "
"transmet toutes les données de requête et de réponse sur l'internet public. "
"Pour te connecter à IBM Quantum Platform en utilisant un VPE, tu dois "
"utiliser l'API ou le SDK d'IBM Quantum Platform. IBM Quantum Platform n'est "
"accessible que via le réseau public.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Avant de commencer {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before you target a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform, complete the following "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Avant de cibler un VPE pour IBM Quantum Platform, effectue les étapes "
"suivantes :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"getting-started).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crée un Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"getting-started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Plan for the network topology](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"planning-considerations) to connect to VPEs.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Planifie la topologie réseau](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"planning-considerations) pour te connecter aux VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Set access controls](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-"
"acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) for your VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Définis les contrôles d'accès](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"configure-acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) pour ton VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand the [limitations](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"limitations-vpe) of having a VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Comprends les [limitations](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"limitations-vpe) liées à l'utilisation d'un VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand how to [view VPE "
"details](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway).\n"
msgstr ""
"Comprends comment [consulter les détails d'un "
"VPE](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"
msgstr ""
"Configurer un VPE pour IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are several ways to create a VPE gateway. If you use the "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-"
"reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) or "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), you"
" must specify the [Cloud Resource Name "
"(CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) of the region "
"in which you want connect to IBM Quantum Platform. Review the following "
"table for the available regions and CRNs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Il existe plusieurs façons de créer une passerelle VPE. Si tu utilises le "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-"
"reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) ou "
"l'[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), "
"tu dois spécifier le [Cloud Resource Name "
"(CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) de la région "
"dans laquelle tu veux te connecter à IBM Quantum Platform. Consulte le "
"tableau suivant pour les régions et CRN disponibles.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Region | Plans   | Fully Qualified Domain Name (FDQN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Région | Plans   | Nom de domaine complet (FDQN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring an endpoint gateway {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"
msgstr ""
"Configurer une passerelle de point de terminaison {#configuring-an-endpoint-"
"gateway}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To configure a VPE gateway, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Pour configurer une passerelle VPE, suis ces étapes :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List the available services, including IBM Cloud infrastructure services "
"available (by default) for all VPC users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Liste les services disponibles, y compris les services d'infrastructure IBM "
"Cloud disponibles (par défaut) pour tous les utilisateurs VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an endpoint gateway](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"ordering-endpoint-gateway) for IBM Quantum Platform that you want to be "
"privately available to the VPC.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crée une passerelle de point de "
"terminaison](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-ordering-endpoint-"
"gateway) pour IBM Quantum Platform que tu veux rendre accessible en privé au"
" VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Bind a reserved IP address](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-"
"unbind-reserved-ip) to the endpoint gateway.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Associe une adresse IP réservée](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"bind-unbind-reserved-ip) à la passerelle de point de terminaison.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[View the created VPE gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway) associated with IBM Quantum "
"Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Consulte les passerelles VPE "
"créées](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway) associées à IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now your virtual server instances in the VPC can access your IBM Quantum "
"Platform instance privately.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tes instances de serveurs virtuels dans le VPC peuvent désormais accéder à "
"ton instance IBM Quantum Platform en privé.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use your VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"
msgstr ""
"Utiliser ton VPE pour IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After you create an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, follow these "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Après avoir créé une passerelle de point de terminaison pour IBM Quantum "
"Platform, suis ces étapes :\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the VPE with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (Python SDK) {#use-the-vpe-with-"
"qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"
msgstr ""
"Utiliser le VPE avec `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (SDK Python) {#use-the-vpe-with-"
"qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"VPE support requires `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 or later.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"La prise en charge du VPE nécessite `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 ou version ultérieure.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When instantiating `QiskitRuntimeService`, specify "
"`private_endpoint=True`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lors de l'instanciation de `QiskitRuntimeService`, spécifie "
"`private_endpoint=True`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the VPE with the IBM Quantum API {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"
msgstr ""
"Utiliser le VPE avec l'API IBM Quantum {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-"
"api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After creating an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, use the service"
" endpoint's FQDN for the target region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Après avoir créé une passerelle de point de terminaison pour IBM Quantum "
"Platform, utilise le FQDN du point de terminaison de service pour la région "
"cible.\n"
